//!   - `bolt04/onion-error-test.json`: the simple 2-byte failure `2002` returned by
//!     hops[4] over the same 5-hop route as `onion-test.json`, the five hop shared
//!     secrets and `ammag` keys, hops[4]'s `um` key, and the final 292-byte error
//!     packet as the origin receives it.
//!   - `04-onion-routing.md`, "Returning Errors" test vectors: a 320-byte
